# p07 withheld: value exists but is not released
#
# LinkML option: option3 sibling reason slot in this shape (the status is about the datum,
# beside 'has value specification'); the same reason value can ride in option1, 1b or 2.
#
# The assay completed and produced a datum. The released graph has the value specification
# node and unit but no number, plus a GENEPIO:0001810 'restricted access' status about the datum.
#
# A consumer can infer that the value exists and was measured (GENEPIO defines restricted access
# as "the data ... is available but not shared publicly"), so asking the data holder again is
# worthwhile. That is what distinguishes it from p03/p04 'not collected', where no value exists.
# They cannot infer anything about the value itself.

@prefix rdf:     <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs:    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix owl:     <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix xsd:     <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix ex:      <https://example.org/encounter/> .
@prefix BFO:     <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_> .
@prefix IAO:     <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_> .
@prefix OBI:     <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_> .
@prefix GENEPIO: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GENEPIO_> .
@prefix UO:      <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UO_> .

ex:glucoseAssay1 a owl:NamedIndividual , OBI:2100072 ;
    BFO:0000050 ex:encounter1 ;
    OBI:0000293 ex:specimen1 ;
    OBI:0000299 ex:glucoseDatum1 .

ex:glucoseDatum1 a owl:NamedIndividual , IAO:0000109 ;
    IAO:0000136 ex:specimen1 ;
    OBI:0001938 ex:valueSpec1 .

ex:valueSpec1 a owl:NamedIndividual , OBI:0001931 ;
    IAO:0000039 UO:0010067 .
    # numeric value withheld from this release

ex:status7 a owl:NamedIndividual , GENEPIO:0001810 ;
    IAO:0000136 ex:glucoseDatum1 .
